{"id":"ad8a244f68941668","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality.md","title":"Changing a Letter at One GL World","display":"lem-modalized-valuation-locality — Changing a Letter at One GL World","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality","aliases":["89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-modalized-valuation-locality — Changing a Letter at One GL World","depends_on":["[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modalized-valuation-locality — Changing a Letter at One GL World"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(W,R,U)\">\\(N=(W,R,U)\\)</span> 共用 GL 框架；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(q)=V(q)\">\\(U(q)=V(q)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}=V(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}\">\\(U(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}=V(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\">\\(p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}locality}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M,w\\models A\\Longleftrightarrow N,w\\models A,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;(M,v\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models B),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to(M,v\\models C\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models C)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}locality}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M,w\\models A\\Longleftrightarrow N,w\\models A,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;(M,v\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models B),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to(M,v\\models C\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models C)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 72–73、107、116–117；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>第三式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 归纳：传递性使任一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 后继的全部后继仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 后继，非自反性使这些世界均不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>，所以原子赋值与所有递归真值保持。模态化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是盒子公式和其他字母的布尔组合，第三式给其每个当前盒子的真值保持，得到第一式。第二式是对不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的结构归纳，甚至无需 GL 框架条件。原书将此作为第 4 章 continuity 的推论使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"N=(W,R,U)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"U(q)=V(q)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"U(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}=V(p)\\setminus\\{w\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}locality}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&M,w\\models A\\Longleftrightarrow N,w\\models A,\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in W\\;(M,v\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models B),\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to(M,v\\models C\\Longleftrightarrow N,v\\models C)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1657,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["138d8c34e0370a6b","71b4f56d6213ff7c","9f00301866fbd6f0","c6ab46cd662b1409"]}